<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Payless ShoeSource.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Payless ShoeSource.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said Friday it reiterated its buy rating on Payless ShoeSource Inc with a 12-month price target of $68 a share.</p>
<p>-- Payless shares were off 1-7/16 at 56-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Given the outlook for strong second quarter earnings and solid prospects for the second half of 1997, including a good start to the back-to-school season, Gruntal said it would take advantage of recent weakness to establish or add to positions in Payless ShoeSource.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
